168,"_35":112,"_113":169,"_170":171,"_172":173,"_115":174,"_117":118},{"_33":161,"_35":112,"_113":162,"_115":163,"_117":118},{"_33":154,"_35":112,"_113":155,"_115":156,"_117":128},{"_33":133,"_35":112,"_113":134,"_115":135,"_117":118},{"_33":125,"_35":112,"_113":126,"_115":127,"_117":128},{"_33":111,"_35":112,"_113":114,"_115":116,"_117":118},"e2e3b93978b8","block","children",[119],"markDefs",[],"style","normal",{"_33":120,"_35":121,"_122":123,"_64":124},"c72c3e8fbdce","span","marks",[],"We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. The latest version will always be available on this page, with the \"last updated\" date at the top reflecting when it was changed.","40e62aa91f89",[129],[],"h2",{"_33":130,"_35":121,"_122":131,"_64":132},"9d1160699aab",[],"Changes to this policy","8a11d36019d4",[146,147],[136],{"_33":137,"_35":138,"_139":140,"_141":-5,"_142":143,"_144":145},"c073725828bf","link","href","https://www.oaic.gov.au","internal","kind","external","newTab",true,{"_33":151,"_35":121,"_122":152,"_64":153},{"_33":148,"_35":121,"_122":149,"_64":150},"2e72baefeb9a",[137],"www.oaic.gov.au.","a1c355efccc4",[],"If you believe we have mishandled your personal information, please contact us first so we can try to resolve the matter. If you are not satisfied with our response, you can lodge a complaint with the Office of the Australian Information Commissioner (OAIC) at ","9483d8cb1674",[157],[],{"_33":158,"_35":121,"_122":159,"_64":160},"940ac4516990",[],"Making a complaint","777b685cb034",[164],[],{"_33":165,"_35":121,"_122":166,"_64":167},"68614abb7291",[],"To make any of these requests, please contact us using the details below. We will respond within a reasonable time.","20bb7f0104c3",[175],"level",1,"listItem","bullet",[],{"_33":176,"_35":121,"_122":177,"_64":178},"cfd8992d76a5",[],"Ask us to delete information we hold about you, where we are not required to keep it","7686ee8c2616",[182],[],{"_33":183,"_35":121,"_122":184,"_64":185},"31c7f048328c",[],"Ask us to correct information that is inaccurate or out of date","cf9ae3358f72",[189],[],{"_33":190,"_35":121,"_122":191,"_64":192},"13ea87571fe4",[],"Request access to the personal information we hold about you","e10cb4f8641d",[196],[],{"_33":197,"_35":121,"_122":198,"_64":199},"076e75028d55",[],"Under the Australian Privacy Principles, you have the right to:","bc110105c451",[203],[],{"_33":204,"_35":121,"_122":205,"_64":206},"76207046a978",[],"Your rights","0fac581fada4",[210],[],{"_33":211,"_35":121,"_122":212,"_64":213},"9b8f9bb86541",[],"Our website uses only the cookies and similar technologies necessary for it to function and to provide spam protection. We do not use advertising or marketing tracking cookies. If we introduce analytics or tracking in the future, we will update this policy and seek your consent where required.","3cad1c41ee3f",[217],[],{"_33":218,"_35":121,"_122":219,"_64":220},"6b7b28ee1366",[],"Cookies","c922f14d9b90",[224],[],{"_33":225,"_35":121,"_122":226,"_64":227},"c8ccdb09ac2c",[],"We take reasonable steps to protect your personal information from misuse, loss, and unauthorised access or disclosure. However, no method of transmission over the internet or electronic storage is completely secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute security.","e6eb159df04c",[231],[],{"_33":232,"_35":121,"_122":233,"_64":234},"d941ec91bb77",[],"Security","35b9fb80c92b",[238],[],{"_33":239,"_35":121,"_122":240,"_64":241},"84e65cbd937b",[],"We keep enquiry information for as long as necessary to respond to and follow up on your enquiry, and to maintain reasonable business records. When it is no longer needed, we take reasonable steps to delete it.","b34730885c98",[245],[],{"_33":246,"_35":121,"_122":247,"_64":248},"46c55cb59602",[],"How long we keep it","2f7d75a995b8",[252],[],{"_33":253,"_35":121,"_122":254,"_64":255},"3338473f5da4",[],"Some of these providers may store or process data on servers located outside Australia. Where this occurs, we take reasonable steps to ensure your information is handled consistently with the Australian Privacy Principles. By submitting your information, you consent to it being stored and processed by these providers, which may include storage overseas.","9ac2512c715e",[259,260],[],{"_33":264,"_35":121,"_122":265,"_64":266},{"_33":261,"_35":121,"_122":262,"_64":263},"eeb36e771fd0",[]," — hosts our website","0944a0c1d15e",[267],"Vercel","strong","3a3d63087d5e",[271,272],[],{"_33":276,"_35":121,"_122":277,"_64":278},{"_33":273,"_35":121,"_122":274,"_64":275},"2e331edb0a61",[]," — provides the spam-protection verification described above","ed1e88742028",[267],"Cloudflare","656329a84c8e",[282,283],[],{"_33":287,"_35":121,"_122":288,"_64":289},{"_33":284,"_35":121,"_122":285,"_64":286},"d3a5a5d1029d",[]," — delivers email notifications to us when you submit an enquiry","920cc5aa70fe",[267],"Resend","15b1a97b2467",[293,294],[],{"_33":298,"_35":121,"_122":299,"_64":300},{"_33":295,"_35":121,"_122":296,"_64":297},"75873bfd6261",[]," — stores the content of our website and the enquiries submitted through the contact form","24ecb2bb6edf",[267],"Sanity","f0fdfa9485f3",[304],[],{"_33":305,"_35":121,"_122":306,"_64":307},"b5201e5f0c70",[],"We use trusted third-party service providers to operate our website and manage enquiries. These providers act as our data processors and only handle your information to provide their service to us:","cbc27a31ce4e",[311],[],{"_33":312,"_35":121,"_122":313,"_64":314},"6bd2b5f03412",[],"Who we share it with and where it is stored","172b7ec4b6e1",[318],[],{"_33":319,"_35":121,"_122":320,"_64":321},"dfc8f7a95b7c",[],"To protect our contact form from automated abuse, we use Cloudflare Turnstile, a privacy-focused verification tool. Turnstile helps confirm that submissions come from real people rather than bots. It may collect limited technical information (such as your IP address and basic browser signals) for the sole purpose of this verification. Cloudflare processes this information on our behalf; see Cloudflare's own privacy policy for details.","2d0bbb1b6b70",[325],[],{"_33":326,"_35":121,"_122":327,"_64":328},"81053bd4f75a",[],"Spam protection","7d8b8e87d75c",[332],[],{"_33":333,"_35":121,"_122":334,"_64":335},"bb1b61ab8f5d",[],"We do not use your information for marketing unless you have separately agreed to that, and we do not sell your personal information to anyone.","34f8a7195510",[339],[],{"_33":340,"_35":121,"_122":341,"_64":342},"92fc0de84b82",[],"Keep a record of enquiries we have received","9c6b5e354b6e",[346],[],{"_33":347,"_35":121,"_122":348,"_64":349},"90dac52c2092",[],"Discuss your potential project and provide quotes or information","1e2f0ebc4706",[353],[],{"_33":354,"_35":121,"_122":355,"_64":356},"8d697f26f886",[],"Respond to your enquiry","126e04661efb",[360],[],{"_33":361,"_35":121,"_122":362,"_64":363},"58d0f59ad764",[],"We use the information you provide solely to:","0c07018a7355",[367],[],{"_33":368,"_35":121,"_122":369,"_64":370},"d82128d5f8d1",[],"Why we collect it and how we use it","9cbf352ceba7",[374],[],{"_33":375,"_35":121,"_122":376,"_64":377},"f7706d449909",[],"We collect this information directly from you when you complete and submit the contact form on our website. We do not purchase personal information from third parties or collect it from other sources.","a036b9ce3a79",[381],[],{"_33":382,"_35":121,"_122":383,"_64":384},"0431052675bf",[],"How we collect it","657188a3f30e",[388],[],{"_33":389,"_35":121,"_122":390,"_64":391},"b8cc0febff81",[],"We do not require you to create an account, and we do not ask for sensitive information such as financial details through this website.","4a0fbee9dc13",[395],[],{"_33":396,"_35":121,"_122":397,"_64":398},"a4005ce73e7c",[],"Any details you include in your message","61038072a7af",[402],[],{"_33":403,"_35":121,"_122":404,"_64":405},"8a929e68bbc8",[],"The type of project you're enquiring about","c55c2b953ce4",[409],[],{"_33":410,"_35":121,"_122":411,"_64":412},"49347b19e6fc",[],"Your phone number (if you provide it)","2c10afa836d1",[416],[],{"_33":417,"_35":121,"_122":418,"_64":419},"0848b97d1258",[],"Your email address","9461964e427e",[423],[],{"_33":424,"_35":121,"_122":425,"_64":426},"2a480e0c34aa",[],"Your first and last name","c0de020604ce",[430],[],{"_33":431,"_35":121,"_122":432,"_64":433},"e81bdbdc5f58",[],"We only collect personal information that you choose to provide to us through our contact form. This includes:","84cdf5af1f31",[437],[],{"_33":438,"_35":121,"_122":439,"_64":440},"aaa482a747fc",[],"What information we collect","13ac2e4c588d",[444],[],{"_33":445,"_35":121,"_122":446,"_64":447},"32067d72a623",[],"SIARI Build is a residential construction business based in Melbourne, Victoria. If you have any questions about this policy or about how we handle your personal information, you can contact us using the details at the end of this page.","fd3a4e36ffc1",[451],[],{"_33":452,"_35":121,"_122":453,"_64":454},"4d47a40284d0",[],"Who we are","7801819e6036",[458],[],{"_33":459,"_35":121,"_122":460,"_64":461},"752ae7b67d2f",[],"This Privacy Policy explains how SIARI Build (\"we\", \"us\", \"our\") collects, uses, stores, and discloses your personal information when you visit our website or get in touch with us. We are committed to protecting your privacy and handling your personal information in accordance with the Australian Privacy Act 1988 (Cth) and the Australian Privacy Principles (APPs).","f6abd20f00a7","heroInner","https://cdn.sanity.io/images/f0yvhrzy/production/0c347f77c916e104658c4385ea049edcf497aa0e-1672x941.jpg","legal","Your Privacy","compact","How we collect, use, and protect your personal information.",{"_470":471,"_472":473},"settings",{"_512":513,"_514":515,"_516":517,"_518":519,"_520":145,"_521":522,"_523":-5,"_524":525,"_526":145,"_527":-5,"_528":-5,"_529":-5,"_530":531,"_532":533,"_534":-5,"_535":536,"_537":538,"_539":540,"_541":542,"_543":544},"navigation",{"_474":475,"_476":145,"_477":478,"_479":